<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy buying back up to 2.0 trln lire BOTs.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy buying back up to 2.0 trln lire BOTs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it would buy back up to 2.0 trillion lire of short term bills (BOTs) expiring between June 30 and December 30 1997.</p>
<p>Bids must be received by 0845 GMT.</p>
</text>
